flowchart TD
    %% Shopping Cart and Checkout Workflow
    Start([User Initiates Checkout from Cart]) --> CheckAuth{Is User Authenticated?}
    CheckAuth -- No --> RedirectLogin[Redirect to /login with State: from=/checkout]
    RedirectLogin --> AuthDone[User Signs In]
    AuthDone --> Start
    
    CheckAuth -- Yes --> FetchCart[GET /api/cart - Load Items & Subtotals in Paise]
    FetchCart --> AddressStep{Has Saved Delivery Address?}
    
    AddressStep -- No --> CreateAddress[POST /api/orders/addresses - Validate PIN & Phone]
    CreateAddress --> AddressStep
    
    AddressStep -- Yes --> SelectAddress[Select Shipping Address]
    SelectAddress --> QuotePricing[POST /api/cart/quote - Calculate Tax & Delivery Fee]
    
    QuotePricing --> CouponCheck{User Enters Coupon Code?}
    CouponCheck -- Yes --> ValidateCoupon[POST /api/coupons/apply - Check Validity & Min Cart]
    ValidateCoupon --> ApplyDiscount[Apply Percentage or Fixed Paise Discount]
    CouponCheck -- No --> ReviewSummary[Review Final Payable Amount]
    ApplyDiscount --> ReviewSummary
    
    ReviewSummary --> ChoosePayment{Select Payment Method}
    ChoosePayment -- Cash On Delivery (COD) --> PlaceOrderCOD[POST /api/orders/checkout with method: 'cod']
    PlaceOrderCOD --> AtomicTransactCOD[MongoDB Atomic Transaction: Reserve Stock]
    AtomicTransactCOD --> OrderPlacedCOD[Order Marked as 'pending' / Ready for Dispatch]
    
    ChoosePayment -- Razorpay Online --> PlaceOrderRzp[POST /api/orders/checkout with method: 'razorpay']
    PlaceOrderRzp --> CreateRzpOrder[Backend Generates Razorpay Order ID]
    CreateRzpOrder --> LaunchRzp[Launch Razorpay Modal on Frontend]
    LaunchRzp --> ProceedPayment[Proceed to Payment Gateway Workflow]
